      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Let's be honest, VRChat is not safe for streamers at all. Having private avatar lost it's meaning. Either you are using public one, or you are forced to be living in a small isolated bubble.\nIf this was implemented on API level, and also had an option to be limited to friends/custom whitelist, it would limit model ripping a lot and make game much more safe. New fallback system would empower this feature by a lot, allowing to show cheap and optimized version of avatar to other people, while keeping custom personalized avatar safe.",
